# Retrieved-evidence cache. Regenerable and large; keeping it out of git avoids
# committing thousands of small JSON files. Note it is what makes evaluation
# runs replayable offline, so don't delete it casually — a rebuild costs
# NewsAPI quota and a lot of wall time.
cache/
results/eval_cache/

# Stray scratch diffs/patches
*.diff
*.patch

